# Claimed lowercase SHA-256 of the ADR 0005 canonical schedule bytes.
string<=64 schedule_hash
robotest_interfaces/FaultSpec[<=16] faults
---
uint8 STATE_RESET=0
uint8 STATE_PREPARED=1
uint8 STATE_ARMED=2

bool accepted
bool replayed
uint8 state
string<=64 schedule_hash
uint32 loaded_count
uint64 generation
string<=256 message
